# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — never commit it.
#
# User OAuth token (xoxp-…) so files post as you, not as a bot.
# Create at https://api.slack.com/apps → Create New App → From scratch (Porter workspace)
#   → OAuth & Permissions → User Token Scopes: files:write, chat:write
#   → Install to Workspace → copy "User OAuth Token".
# If the workspace requires admin approval for new apps, the install step will request it.
SLACK_USER_TOKEN=
